DESCRIPTION:Bianca Cristovao is a Los Angeles-based stand-up comedian from 
 the Czech Republic. She gained recognition after her debut on The Late Show
  with Stephen Colbert\, released her mini special Green Card Digger with D
 on't Tell Comedy\, performed at Netflix Is a Joke and Just for Laughs\, and
  has toured with Bill Burr since 2022.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/
